    <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <div class="px-5 py-3 border-b border-white/5">
            <code class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold">tone_resting(tone, lit)</code>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1.5">Internal to the catalogue &mdash; it composes part of a widget rather than being called from a view. Documented so the file reads end to end; treat it as implementation detail.</p>
